507	## 6. Shared contracts (`src/contracts/`, frozen after Phase 0)
508	
509	These files are the interface between workstreams. Phase 0 writes them completely, along with fixtures in `src/contracts/fixtures/` (one product, one pantry of 12 items, two original recipes, one adapted recipe, one cooking session, one day of meals). After Phase 0 they change only through the protocol in §18.5.
