841	## 7. API route contracts (`src/contracts/api.ts`)
842	
843	General rules for every route:
844	- Node runtime (`export const runtime = 'nodejs'`). The first line is `const user = await requireUser()`, which returns 401 `UNAUTHORIZED` when there is no session.
845	- Bodies are validated with Zod. Errors use the shape below. Success returns the typed payload directly, with no envelope.
846	- The user id comes **only** from the session. Never accept `userId` in a request.
847	- Per-user rate limits (in-memory token bucket in `src/lib/rate-limit.ts`): `/api/recipes/search` 6/min, `/api/recipes/*/adapt` 6/min, `/api/vision/*` 10/min, `/api/tts` 60/min, `/api/products/lookup` 30/min.
